  "detail_text": "Pre-solicitation Notice Presolicitation Notice Pre-solicitation Notice *=Required Field Presolicitation Notice SUBJECT* PRE-SOLICITATION GENERAL INFORMATION CONTRACTING OFFICE S ZIP CODE* 60141 SOLICITATION NUMBER* 36H79725R0003 RESPONSE DATE/TIME/ZONE (July 25, 2025) (12:00pm) (Central Time) ARCHIVE (60 days) DAYS AFTER THE RESPONSE DATE SET-ASIDE (N/A) PRODUCT SERVICE CODE* 6525 NAICS CODE* 334517 PLACE OF PERFORMANCE As indicated on individual delivery order Against the contract. POSTAL CODE COUNTRY CONTACT INFORMATION CONTRACTING OFFICE ADDRESS Department of Veterans Affairs) OPAL/National Acquisition Center Building 37 1st Ave, One Block North of Cermak Hines, IL 60141 POINT OF CONTACT* LaTonya L. Whiteside LaTonya.Whiteside@va.gov Marissa Wright Marissa.Wright@va.gov ADDITIONAL INFORMATION AGENCY S URL URL DESCRIPTION AGENCY CONTACT S EMAIL ADDRESS EMAIL DESCRIPTION DESCRIPTION Industry The Department of Veterans Affairs National Acquisition Center (VA NAC) and the Defense Logistics Agency (DLA) Troop Support Solicitation for Radiology & Imaging Systems. This is a Draft RFP for contractor response and input only. The Government will not award a contract in response to the DRAFT RFP. The Draft RFP is not an authorization to begin performance and in no way obligates the Government for any costs incurred by the contractor for this requirement. The Government will not award a contract in response to the subject DRAFT RFP. Potential Offerors are requested to respond to the DRAFT solicitation by July 25, 2025, 12 PM Central Time (CT). Offerors should use Attachment # 10 DRAFT Solicitation Question Matrix to provide any feedback, questions, comments, or concerns. Please submit to LaTonya L. Whiteside @ latonya.whiteside@va.gov. After receiving feedback, if deemed appropriate, the Government will update the Solicitation and supporting documents before releasing the official solicitation 36H79725R0003.",
